# Local working copy of original releases and other ports. Never committed: the extension rules above
# catch most of it, but .LZH, .DMS and .flux disk images slipped through, so the directory is ignored
# outright. tools/check_no_game_data.py is the backstop if anything is ever staged anyway.
game-sources/
*.iso
__pycache__/
*.pyc
build/
build-*/
*.wav
!tests/audio/fixtures/*.wav
.claude/settings.local.json
.DS_Store
dist/
*.cue
*.mov
*.mp4
*.mkv
# the synthetic example pack (generated tones, no game audio); tools/check_no_game_data.py allows only this folder
!examples/asset-pack-skeleton/**/*.wav
